{
  "_comment": "Settings for the model runs (Test A: image only; Test B: image + the region's rule passages). The API key is read from the environment variable named in api.api_key_env, usually set in .env. Relative workspace names are resolved under DATASETS_ROOT (set in .env) or datasets_root.",
